PVTO
-- Column 1: dissolved gas-oil ratio (sm3/sm3)
-- Column 2: bubble point pressure (bar)
-- Column 3: oil FVF for saturated oil (rb per stb)
-- Column 4: oil viscosity for saturated oil (cP)
0.8749	1.0000	1.0675	1.5904 /
4.8717	9.7083	1.0782	1.4082 /
